<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Why? It ain’t fair!\nWhy is it only pics of homies?\rWhy ain’t there no pics of ladies?\nThis discrimination!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Climbin’ a mountain for the\nview is one thing...\rBut peekin’ at other people’s\nPC Boxes gimme a guilty thrill.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know?\nAbout my PC Box, I mean.\rIt’s full of homies everybody\nwant, like...\r...Nah, I ain’t gon’ say. It’d\nsound like I’m braggin’.\rIf you REALLY gotta know, you can\nfind out yourself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I come every day to check on other\npeople’s Dress-Up Data.\rFor me, it’s the first step to\nfashion! Drip research.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, my! Good gracious!\nThis almost scandalous!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For homie and Accessory combos,\nyou can get ideas from\fothers by watchin’ what they do.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The same Accessory can give\ntotally different vibes.\rIt deadass depend on where and how\nyou use it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I won a Backdrop drawin’ for\nAccessories in the Goldenrod Tunnel.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What I like to do...\rI like peepin’ the people\ncheckin’ out Dress-Up Data.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Warps to the GTS and the Hustler\nRankings on 1F.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Warps to the Battle Video Gallery on 3F.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\nConnection for Dress-Up Data? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here, you can post the Dress-Up Data\nof your homies.\rYou can set up and save Dress-Up\nData in the Goldenrod Tunnel.\rYou can also peep Dress-Up Data\nother Hustlers posted.\rYou can sort the data by homie\nto make it easy to browse.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\nConnection for Box Data? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here, you can post Box Data\nwith your homies in it.\rPick a wallpaper, then put your\nhomies on it to set the scene.\rWhen you done, post it for other\nHustlers to see.\rYou can also peep Box Data other\nHustlers posted.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">USE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0601_T25R1202_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
</body>
